<title>CHINA: Deutsche Bank plans HK Telecom warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank plans HK Telecom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London branch, said on Friday it planned to issue 700 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.  STRIKE PRICE	HK$20	  PREMIUM	 20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.40	GEARING	 5.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18.MAY.98    LISTING DATE  TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$20	  MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  PHYSICAL ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
